WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.600
Speaker 1: Well, as the United States&nbsp;
gets closer to the 4th of July holiday,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.760
a number of different shortages are&nbsp;
threatening the holiday, I guess&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:07.760 --> 00:00:12.640
if you want to think about it in the most&nbsp;
standard way. But this is a good opportunity&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:12.640 --> 00:00:17.120
to talk about a number of the different areas in&nbsp;
which there are shortages. I think it's important&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:22.080
for context, why are we talking about this?&nbsp;
We're talking about this because, number one,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:26.960
I have no interest in hiding shortages just&nbsp;
because Joe Biden is president. That's a common&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:31.680
one that I'm accused of. And secondly, none of&nbsp;
these things have anything to do with Joe Biden,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:31.680 --> 00:00:36.400
particularly when you consider the global nature&nbsp;
of many of these shortages. A few things to be&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:44.080
aware of. There is a structure shortage. This is a&nbsp;
I guess I'm not wrong in calling it an Asian chili&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:44.080 --> 00:00:47.680
sauce. I think that's the way it's&nbsp;
most typically described. And there is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:48.480 --> 00:00:54.960
a lot of breathless coverage of the looming&nbsp;
Sriracha shortage. I love Sriracha. But for me,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:00.880
first of all, by the way, if you really it's just&nbsp;
the primary structure that there is a shortage of.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:00.880 --> 00:01:07.520
So there are all sorts of other Saroja brands&nbsp;
as well. You can also look at other hot sauces,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:07.520 --> 00:01:13.440
but indeed there is the expectation that the&nbsp;
country's most popular brand of Serratia will&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:13.440 --> 00:01:22.720
be in a shortage coming soon for you. Fong Foods,&nbsp;
the California based producer of this sauce, says&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:22.720 --> 00:01:30.320
they will have to scale back production due to&nbsp;
an abysmal spring crop of Mexican red jalapenos.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:31.280 --> 00:01:35.120
Nothing to do with Joe Biden, Joe.&nbsp;
But it is not Joe Biden's fault&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:35.120 --> 00:01:42.400
that in Mexico they've had a bad crop of red&nbsp;
jalapenos. Okay. With 4th of July coming up.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:42.400 --> 00:01:50.240
Mustard a global mustard shortage is looming&nbsp;
ahead of summer barbecues, as reported by Axios.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:51.120 --> 00:02:00.160
Um. Yeah. A few of the largest mustard brands&nbsp;
like Kraft Heinz say they don't expect shortages,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:00.160 --> 00:02:07.040
but there are some mustards which&nbsp;
will be experiencing stock issues.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:07.760 --> 00:02:13.280
I love a good mustard. I'm partial to grain&nbsp;
mustard and brown deli mustard. I'm just not&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:13.280 --> 00:02:19.040
big on the yellow stuff. It sort of seems a&nbsp;
little bit cartoonish to me. And I know baseball&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:19.040 --> 00:02:25.440
fans won't react kindly to that. No, but in all&nbsp;
seriousness, I love mustard. There will be mustard&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:25.440 --> 00:02:32.560
available, maybe just not the one that you like.&nbsp;
More seriously, there is a medical contrast,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:32.560 --> 00:02:38.960
dye shortage and medical contrast. Dyes are used&nbsp;
for a number of different imaging procedures and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:38.960 --> 00:02:47.440
surgical procedures. I talked recently of my&nbsp;
girlfriend's perforation that she had, and one&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:47.440 --> 00:02:54.720
of the ways that they confirm the perforation has&nbsp;
been fixed is they use one of these contrast dyes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:54.720 --> 00:03:00.400
under imaging and then see if any of the dye&nbsp;
escapes where it's supposed to be. These are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:01.120 --> 00:03:07.760
very important medical materials. It's&nbsp;
used in diagnosing and treating stroke,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:07.760 --> 00:03:12.400
aneurysm, cardiac conditions. These are&nbsp;
essential to hospitals in many ways.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:13.120 --> 00:03:21.120
There is a delay happening there. The global chip&nbsp;
shortage will continue. This predates Joe Biden&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:21.840 --> 00:03:27.760
and has nothing to do with Joe Biden. And industry&nbsp;
experts don't believe there will be relief on the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:27.760 --> 00:03:36.080
chip shortage until 2023. There is a nurse&nbsp;
shortage anecdotally Shreveport, Louisiana,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:36.080 --> 00:03:43.680
warning of a nurse shortage. But this is happening&nbsp;
nationally in many different places. When we've&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:43.680 --> 00:03:47.840
recently been in the hospital for the birth&nbsp;
and for everything else that's been going on,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:48.720 --> 00:03:53.600
many traveling nurses who just like, they'll&nbsp;
they'll they'll literally come up from like&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:53.600 --> 00:03:58.960
Baltimore to New York City for a week and just&nbsp;
work a week in a hospital unfamiliar to them, then&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:58.960 --> 00:04:03.680
go back down to Baltimore. A lot of that going&nbsp;
on to try to deal with the shortage in some areas&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:04.320 --> 00:04:09.840
that is expected to continue. And then lastly for&nbsp;
me, there's other shortages as well. But lastly,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:09.840 --> 00:04:15.920
for what I'll talk about today, a pilot shortage&nbsp;
could lead to flight delays and cancelations.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:15.920 --> 00:04:22.320
And we have already seen that. Already&nbsp;
seen that. So this is a major, large issue&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:22.880 --> 00:04:28.160
which we will continue to follow. Hopefully&nbsp;
everybody's 4th of July will be okay.

